  "details": "1. go to world [Theater And Studio Area]\n\nhttps://vrch.at/w073ddpq\n\n2. Turn to the right and move to the yellow area behind the Talk Show Set.\n\n3. Try to walk into the yellow Area.\n\nThis should bring an I/O Panel to enter security data. Role [CREW] PIN [1111]\n\nIn the Live version it works fine, but when I change to Open-Beta, the Udon Graph doesn't seem to get triggered.\n\nI went in with Quest 2 & PC (Steam), the LIVE has no issue but the Open-Beta doesn't work.\n\nALSO...\n\nThis world has 5 Camera's to switch the camera displaying to the main Monitor... they do not work anymore in Beta but still work in the current live version.\n\nIf you go to the board at the top of the bleachers and click on [Camera 0] - [Camera 4) in Live, you will see the monitors display the view from that camera, in beta they do not work.\n\nThe Udon Graph is likely halting due to an error but this error doesn't occur in Live, and the Creator Companion isn't currently available for the Beta to debug with.\n\nFYI:\n\nWhen I used right shift+tilde+3\n\nI do a Udon graph halting BUT only in Beta, Like has no Udon Halts.",
